    },
    {
      "$id": 2,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "It's my decision."
    },
    {
      "$id": 3,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 4,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 5,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 6,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "In order to perpetuate their existence,"
    },
    {
      "$id": 7,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Zanza and Meyneth must\nuse a being they created"
    },
    {
      "$id": 8,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 9,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "as a physical host."
    },
    {
      "$id": 10,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 11,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "They cannot exist forever as mere souls."
    },
    {
      "$id": 12,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 13,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 14,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 15,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 16,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 17,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "This world was created so that\nthey may continue to exist."
    },
    {
      "$id": 18,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 19,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "It is for this reason that its existence,\nand future, is in their hands."
    },
    {
      "$id": 20,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 21,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 22,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 23,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 24,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 25,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "This is the passage of fate."
    },
    {
      "$id": 26,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 27,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "And your visions."
    },
    {
      "$id": 28,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 29,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "People live and die at the mercy of Zanza."
    },
    {
      "$id": 30,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 31,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 32,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 33,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "And through this, Zanza maintains\nthe existence of this world."
    },
    {
      "$id": 34,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 35,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Our destruction was always inevitable."
    },
    {
      "$id": 36,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 37,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 38,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 39,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Everything we did was meaningless."
    },
    {
      "$id": 40,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 41,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 42,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Are you certain?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 43,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 44,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "It was his will to revive you\nand use you as a host."
    },
    {
      "$id": 45,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 46,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 47,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 48,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Taking the Monado from Meyneth,\ndoing with the world as he wishes..."
    },
    {
      "$id": 49,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 50,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 51,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 52,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Everything was as he decided."
    },
    {
      "$id": 53,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 54,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 55,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "But why is it that Zanza\nnow wishes to destroy you?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 56,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 57,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "What is the need for this?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 58,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 59,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "That's because..."
    },
    {
      "$id": 60,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 61,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "He in fact has no choice but to do it."
    },
    {
      "$id": 62,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 63,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 64,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "If he does not, he risks his entire existence."
    },
    {
      "$id": 65,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 66,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "And we're the source of that risk?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 67,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 68,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "But why?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 69,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "It is a marvel to exist outside\nthe passage of fate."
    },
    {
      "$id": 70,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 71,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 72,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 73,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "The lives created by Zanza and Meyneth"
    },
    {
      "$id": 74,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 75,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "inevitably attempt to escape the passage of fate."
    },
    {
      "$id": 76,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 77,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "[ML:undisp ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 78,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 79,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "This signifies the beginning of their destruction."
    },
    {
      "$id": 80,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 81,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Meyneth accepted this, and entrusted\nthe future of this world"
    },
    {
      "$id": 82,
